   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The present in -are",
   "texto": [
    "To combine a verb in **-are**, the infinitive termination is removed and personal disinences are added: **io -o**, **tu -i**, **lui/lei/Lei -a**, **noi -iamo**, **voi -ate**, **loro -ano**.",
    "Two key details: the **tu** form always ends in **-i** (never * -as *), and in the **loro** form the tonic accent is back to the root, making it a slate word: **PAR-la-no**, **A-bi-ta-no**, **AS-col-ta-no**."
   ]
  },
